{"parentUuid":"21c2d8ca-8f48-4309-8099-a8a1089bf911","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"environment","snapshot":{"workingDirectory":"/Users/danielbentes/agent-capability-standard/.claude/worktrees/wf_08f3cd25-fc3-8","isWorktree":true,"isGitRepo":true,"additionalWorkingDirectories":[],"platform":"darwin","shell":"zsh","osVersion":"Darwin 27.2.0","scratchpadDirectory":"REDACTED"},"changes":[{"field":"workingDirectory","from":"/Users/danielbentes/agent-capability-standard/.claude/worktrees/wf_08f3cd25-fc3-8/site"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"d1b1120d-0aa6-4045-8dc7-100669d8aeb0","timestamp":"2026-11-12T21:05:37.231Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n# Environment update\n - Primary working directory: /Users/danielbentes/agent-capability-standard/.claude/worktrees/wf_08f3cd25-fc3-8 (was /Users/danielbentes/agent-capability-standard/.claude/worktrees/wf_08f3cd25-fc3-8/site)\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"ef9f3fc8-12b6-4fe4-9f49-aaeedec05648","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/danielbentes/agent-capability-standard/.claude/worktrees/wf_08f3cd25-fc3-8","sessionId":"ef9f3fc8-12b6-4fe4-9f49-aaeedec05648","version":"2.1.322","gitBranch":"feature/issue-125-site-visuals","slug":"i-just-came-across-imperative-newell"}
{"parentUuid":"d1b1120d-0aa6-4045-8dc7-100669d8aeb0","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgyiNJLwr6FrZ64VcuDaP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The redesign is finished. The last commit, 8d94ad0, is pushed. Nothing is merged and the live site hasn't changed. I've sent you screenshots of eight page types, each at desktop light, desktop dark and phone width.\n\n**What changed on the site:**\n- Every page type now has figures drawn from the repository's data. The capability pages, workflow step maps, domain pages, the Standard and the index pages all use the same pixel tiles as the periodic table.\n- Every section and concept has its own icon, and no two concepts share one.\n- The long documents (glossary, FAQ, compliance, research, guides) have diagrams written into their Markdown, so GitHub shows them too. Each diagram was checked against the text next to it. That check corrected 18 diagrams and deleted 5. A separate review then removed 98 diagrams that only repeated the table or list next to them. About 45 of those were cut on an automatic overlap score without anyone reading them, so a few useful ones may be gone. They can be restored.\n- No page the build checks has more than two screens of text without a figure, and the build now fails if one does.\n- Your decisions are applied:\n  - no diagrams in the skill files, their reference copies or the changelog;\n  - the first example and the first step card start open;\n  - the six Standard figures are redrawn to the spec;\n  - every status has its own icon.\n\n**Checks at 8d94ad0, on my machine:**\n- Site type and contrast checks, 864 tests and the build all pass.\n- Accessibility: 168 pages in both themes at both widths, with no violations. The first local run failed without reporting a reason and the rerun passed, so the GitHub run is the one to rely on.\n- The repository's own checks also pass: 1,550 tests and the link check.\n\nThe same checks are running on GitHub now (run 43306750439).\n\n**Still open:**\n- **Release notes page:** it has no figure and a very long stretch of text, because you ruled out diagrams in the changelog. One option is a timeline drawn from the version headings. Do you want it?\n- **Long examples:** examples with more than 100 lines of output fold behind a \"show the whole output\" link. Integrate's 94-line example stays open and still uses its existing exemption from the long-text check. Is 100 lines the right limit?\n- **Not checked:** nobody has compared the site with synapti.ai to confirm nothing was copied, or tested it with a real screen reader. Your Safari test is still pending.\n- **Old branch:** please run `! git branch -D spike/issue-120-astro`.\n\nNext I'll open the pull request, which closes #125 when merged. Once the GitHub run passes, merging it publishes the site, and only you can do that."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":627,"cache_read_input_tokens":299516,"output_tokens":877,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":627,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":877,"cache_read_input_tokens":299516,"cache_creation_input_tokens":627,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":627},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"23f7efea-b175-4701-8c90-7e5d45ab49aa","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgyiNG8FXykLBMckHTaUL","requestRef":"de007af8-f644-4138-9fa1-2cad5d8170b9","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"5c7fb2e3-b3c8-45b0-9f0e-e75f1b19a074","timestamp"