{"type":"queue-operation","operation":"enqueue","timestamp":"2026-11-13T06:50:03.307Z","sessionId":"ef9f3fc8-12b6-4fe4-9f49-aaeedec05648","content":"<task-notification>\n<task-id>a51ed6eadc0b80762</task-id>\n<output-file>REDACTED.output</output-file>\n<status>completed</status>\n<summary>Agent \"Run all quality commands\" finished</summary>\n<note>A task-notification fires each time this agent stops with no live background children of its own. The user can send it another message and resume it, so the same task-id may notify more than once.</note>\n<result>All 20 commands passed on commit f254598, the head of `feature/issue-125-site-visuals`, on 2026-11-13. Every one exited with code 0, so there is no error output to include. I edited no files. The only file the commands wrote is `tools/validator_suggestions.json`, which `.gitignore` excludes, and `git status` afterwards showed only the `.decisions/` folder that was already untracked.\n\n### Site (in `site/`, Node v26.13.0, matching `.nvmrc`)\n\n| Command | Status | Summary line it printed |\n|---|---|---|\n| `npm ci` | Pass | `added 422 packages, and audited 423 packages in 5s` / `found 0 vulnerabilities` |\n| `npm run check` | Pass | `Result (286 files): - 0 errors - 0 warnings - 0 hints`; `check-contrast: 412 pairs in light and dark meet 4.5:1 (text) and 3:1 (edges)`; `check-design-data: 9 layers have light and dark tokens and a glyph; 207 grids parse; 48 glyph keys from the data have a grid; 20 status values have a style; no hand-typed counts in 263 source files` |\n| `npm test` | Pass | `Test Files  38 passed (38)` / `Tests  875 passed (875)` |\n| `npm run build` | Pass | Pagefind: `Indexed 168 pages`; `check-dist: every check passed (files, links, md-links, copies, sitemap, figures, drawn, legends, review)`; `check-dist: links: 27598 internal links checked` |\n| `npm run check:axe` | Pass | `check-axe: 168 pages, 672 runs (light and dark at 1440 and 360px): no axe violations, no sideways scroll at 360px, no data-flow grid scrolls at 1440px`; `check-runs: 168 pages; 12 meet the 900px target; 0 enforced page(s) have a run over 1800px (enforced)` |\n\n`npm ci` printed one warning, which did not stop it: `fsevents@2.3.3` has install scripts that `allowScripts` does not cover yet.\n\n### Repo root (with `/Users/danielbentes/agent-capability-standard/.venv` active)\n\nThe active `grounded_agency` package was the one in this worktree, not the main checkout's.\n\n| Command | Status | Summary line it printed |\n|---|---|---|\n| `pytest tests -q` | Pass | `1550 passed in 82.31s (0:01:22)` |\n| `validate_workflows.py --strict` | Pass | `VALIDATION PASS` |\n| Catalog loop (5 catalogs) | Pass | `VALIDATION PASS` for each: data_analysis, healthcare, manufacturing, personal_assistant, digital_twin_sync_loop |\n| `validate_profiles.py` | Pass | `PROFILE VALIDATION PASS: 7 profiles validated` |\n| `validate_skill_refs.py` | Pass | `SKILL REFERENCE VALIDATION PASS: 42 skills validated` |\n| `validate_ontology.py` | Pass | `VALIDATION PASSED` (34 of 36 capabilities have incoming edges; 0 orphan capabilities) |\n| `validate_canonical_schemas.py` | Pass | `CANONICAL SCHEMA VALIDATION PASS: 5 schemas validated` |\n| `validate_rfcs.py` | Pass | `RFC VALIDATION PASS: 4 RFCs validated` |\n| `validate_constraints.py` | Pass | `OK: 1 pin(s) in constraints.txt agree with pyproject.toml` |\n| `validate_doc_links.py` | Pass | `OK: 315 reference(s) across 164 file(s) resolve` |\n| `validate_yaml_util_sync.py` | Pass | `YAML util sync OK — 4 definitions match` |\n| `validate_transform_refs.py` | Pass | `TRANSFORM REFERENCE VALIDATION PASS: 5 refs validated` |\n| `validate_benchmark_deps.py` | Pass | `PASS: All benchmark dependencies validated against ontology` |\n| `sync_skill_schemas.py --check` | Pass | `SYNC CHECK PASS: 107 generated files up to date` |\n| `gen_runtime_fixtures.py --check` | Pass | `175 runtime fixtures up to date` |\n\n### How the numbers were collected\n- **Exit codes:** the first pass of the validators returned no exit codes, because the shell is zsh and does not set `PIPESTATUS`. I ran them again without a pipe and every exit code was 0.\n- **pytest line:** the shell's rtk proxy shortened the first pytest run to `1550 passed in 143.77s`. I ran it again with the proxy bypassed to get the exact line above. Both runs passed 1550 tests.\n- **Site commands:** I ran them one after another, so `check:axe` checked the `dist/` folder that `npm run build` had just produced. The full logs are in `REDACTED`.</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>41491</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>11</tool_uses><duration_ms>475658</duration_ms></usage>\n</task-notification>"}
