layer-verify-usage-1440-light.png  39.1K\nlayer-verify-usage-360-light.png  39.6K\noverview-directory-tree-1440-dark.png  152.5K\noverview-directory-tree-1440-light.png  151.0K\noverview-directory-tree-360-light.png  132.8K\nrfc-index-1440-dark.png  40.2K\nrfc-index-1440-light.png  39.9K\nrfc-index-360-light.png  39.3K\nsection-index-spec-1440-dark.png  115.4K\nsection-index-spec-1440-light.png  116.5K\nsection-index-spec-360-light.png  46.5K\nstandard-step-anatomy-1440-dark.png  84.8K\nstandard-step-anatomy-1440-light.png  84.2K\nstandard-step-anatomy-360-light.png  256.2K\nworkflow-model-deployment-steps-1440-dark.png  96.8K\nworkflow-model-deployment-steps-1440-light.png  96.3K\nworkflow-model-deployment-steps-360-light.png  59.3K\nworkflows-index-table-1440-dark.png  152.3K\nworkflows-index-table-1440-light.png  151.6K\n... (1 more)\n[see remaining: tail -n +1 \"$HOME/Library/Application Support/rtk/tee/1794487306_ls-hidden.log\"]","is_error":false}]}}
