{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"ef9f3fc8-12b6-4fe4-9f49-aaeedec05648","hash":"d8308ece355fbbdeab138835accea51ec456239e94ecbb631a17b3aa873caea9","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0167ttbU4qH4r261suxcW6SH","type":"tool_result","content":"53-\n54-Issues #3, #4, and #5 proposed additional capabilities for these layers. After first-principles evaluation, all were rejected because they failed the criteria in `docs/methodology/FIRST_PRINCIPLES_REASSESSMENT.md`:\n55-\n56:**Proposals that are workflow patterns:**\n57-- `listen` = loop of `receive`\n58-- `coordinate` = `decompose` + `delegate` + `synchronize` + `integrate`\n59-- `compress` = `recall` + `integrate` + `transform` + `persist`\n60-\n61-```mermaid\n62----\n63:title: Proposals that are workflow patterns\n64----\n65-flowchart LR\n66-  accDescr: Each proposal on the left is a composition of the existing capabilities it points to, as the list above says.\n67-  listen[\"listen\"] --> receive[\"receive\"]\n68-  coordinate[\"coordinate\"] --> decompose[\"decompose\"]\n69-  coordinate --> delegate[\"delegate\"]\n70-  coordinate --> synchronize[\"synchronize\"]\n71-  coordinate --> integrate[\"integrate\"]\n72-  compress[\"compress\"] --> recall[\"recall\"]\n73-  compress --> integrate\n74-  compress --> transform[\"transform\"]\n75-  compress --> persist[\"persist\"]\n76-```\n77-\n78-**Proposals that are parameter variations:**\n79-- `sample` = `search` with `limit`\n80-- `scan` = `search` with exhaustive query\n81-- `broadcast` = `send` with multiple destinations\n82-\n83-```mermaid\n84----\n85-title: Proposals that are parameter variations\n86----\n87-flowchart LR\n88-  accDescr: Each proposal on the left is an existing capability with a parameter set, as the list above says.\n89-  sample[\"sample\"] -->|with limit| search[\"search\"]\n90-  scan[\"scan\"] -->|exhaustive query| search\n91-  broadcast[\"broadcast\"] -->|many destinations| send[\"send\"]\n92-```\n93-\n94-**Proposals covered by existing capabilities:**\n95-- `observe` already exists\n96-- `negotiate` covered by `synchronize`\n97-- `handoff` covered by `delegate` with context\n98-- `forget` covered by `persist(ttl: 0)` or `mutate(delete)`\n99-- `index` and `associate` covered by MODEL layer capabilities\n100-\n101-```mermaid\n102----\n103-title: Proposals covered by existing capabilities","is_error":false}]}}
