e named. An area counts an entry when the entry names a path in it in code formatting.\nv1.2.0 Added {\"rows\":[{\"area\":\"tools\",\"count\":1}],\"none\":16} 0 | 17 entries: the most name tools/ (1); 16 entries name no path; no diagnostic code is named. An area counts an entry when the entry names a path in it in code formatting.\nv1.1.0 Added {\"rows\":[],\"none\":9} 0 | 9 entries: none names a repository path; 9 entries name no path; no diagnostic code is named. An area counts an entry when the entry names a path in it in code formatting.\nv1.0.0 Added {\"rows\":[],\"none\":11} 0 | 11 entries: none names a repository path; 11 entries name no path; no diagnostic code is named. An area counts an entry when the entry names a path in it in code formatting.","is_error":false}]}}
{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"ef9f3fc8-12b6-4fe4-9f49-aaeedec05648","hash":"ad0761cf8a2d307478eccaf23f09cf774a0661d2a136d98e31f6468710062156","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Most repository-area entries name no path, so I'm dropping those bars. I'm checking whether the cited issues and diagnostic codes in the changelog are enough for a figure.\n\n","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_016jUSWWUpExqK53dKTX21m3","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/danielbentes/agent-capability-standard/.claude/worktrees/i125-relnotes && python3 - <<'EOF'\nimport re\ns=open('CHANGELOG.md').read()\nfor sec in re.split(r'\\n(?=## \\[)', s)[1:4]:\n    head=sec.splitlines()[0]\n    for k in re.split(r'\\n(?=### )', sec)[1:]:\n        kh=k.splitlines()[0]\n        ents=re.split(r'\\n(?=- )', k)[1:]\n        iss={}\n        for e in ents:\n            for i in set(re.findall(r'#(\\d{2,4})\\b', e)): iss[i]=iss.get(i,0)+1\n        print(head[:20], kh, len(ents), sorted(iss.items(), key=lambda x:-x[1])[:8], sum(1 for e in ents if not re.search(r'#\\d{2,4}\\b',e)))\nEOF\ngrep -rn \"diag-tile\" site/src/pixel/hast.ts site/src/plugins/rehype-spec-slots.ts site/src/lib/*.ts | head -5","description":"Count issues cited per changelog section"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
