s of YAML; matches its sibling \"Caption, then narration\". |\n| 45 | docs/guides/MODALITY_HANDLING.md | Evidence anchor kinds by modality | kept removed | Table regrouped by modality. |\n| 46 | docs/guides/MODALITY_HANDLING.md | The two multi-modal workflows in the equivalences | kept removed | The table cells already write both chains. |\n| 47 | docs/guides/MODALITY_HANDLING.md | The content moderation workflow | restored | A 10-step, 130-line workflow with a parallel group marked only by fields. |\n| 48 | docs/guides/ORCHESTRATION_EXTENSIONS.md | Each trigger kind's default attendance | kept removed | Table rows as arrows. |\n| 49 | docs/guides/RUNNING_WORKFLOWS.md | Driving a run by hand | restored | Shows the next/submit loop and the snapshot exit, which the code lists as straight lines. |\n| 50 | docs/integrations/claude_agent_sdk.md | The skill to checkpoint flow | kept removed | The text block above is already an arrow diagram. |\n| 51 | …/AGENT_ARCHITECTURE_RESEARCH.md | The ReAct loop | kept removed | The text already writes Thought → Action → Observation → Thought. |\n| 52 | …/AGENT_ARCHITECTURE_RESEARCH.md | What the recommendation renames and removes | kept removed | Table rows as arrows. |\n| 53 | …/AGENT_ARCHITECTURE_RESEARCH.md | ReAct phases and the capabilities in each | kept removed | Three rows fanned out. |\n| 54 | …/FIRST_PRINCIPLES_REASSESSMENT.md | The agent loop | kept removed | The text already writes the loop with \"(repeat)\". |\n| 55 | …/FIRST_PRINCIPLES_REASSESSMENT.md | Changes from the previous set | kept removed | Table of renames as arrows. |\n| 56 | …/FIRST_PRINCIPLES_REASSESSMENT.md | Where the other candidates went | kept removed | One arrow per table row. |\n| 57 | docs/methodology/REJECTED_CANDIDATES.md | Reasoning specializations as a domain | kept removed | Two rows. |\n| 58 | …/SKILLS_ALIGNMENT_EVALUATION.md | Splitting act | kept removed | Had a wrong dotted edge; without it, the three-item list as a fan. |\n| 59 | …/SKILLS