{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"ef9f3fc8-12b6-4fe4-9f49-aaeedec05648","hash":"636b48af53b9016bb3448f89ff7607a3bfd924712bfe36c4e870d20e3666e447","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"I've stopped: the disk is full, so no commands can run, including the checks and the push. The last check run got as far as the accessibility check, which passed, before space ran out.\n\n**Where things stand:**\n- The branch on GitHub is at bb97a74, which includes the 16 review fixes.\n- Five more fixes for problems those changes introduced are written but not yet committed:\n  - code-fenced lines in the changelog are no longer counted as entries;\n  - the HTML entity decoder no longer misreads a few names;\n  - the four domain READMEs without a usage section are now listed explicitly, instead of printing warnings on every build;\n  - workflow names are escaped in the page's CSS instead of being restricted;\n  - the design check uses the same code-fence detection as the figure code.\n- One test fails: the design check can't load the shared fence helper from plain Node. Once there's space I'll give the check a Node-loadable version of that helper.\n- No pull request is open yet.\n\n**To free space:** most of what I've created here is screenshots and logs in this session's scratch folder, `REDACTED`. The largest are the review screenshot folders under `visual/` (`rollout/review`, `round3/review`, `round4/review`), with hundreds of full-page images, plus the axe and build logs. None of it is needed for the pull request. I'd keep `visual/round4/final/` and `visual/relnotes/`, since those are what I sent you.\n\nMay I delete those review screenshot folders and logs? They're temporary files from this session, and I can't check their size until some space is free. If something else on your Mac is filling the disk, freeing space there works too. Once there's room I'll finish the fixes, open the pull request, wait for GitHub's checks, merge, and confirm the deployment."}]}}
