{"parentUuid":"bf74de5e-c9dd-4ea6-8ab8-c9891941e719","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgzpoWnhixxuPhvRCZCEp","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The redesign is reviewed, merged and live. PR #126 merged into `main` as a4c00cd, the deploy succeeded, and issue #125 closed automatically. I've sent three screenshots of the live site.\n\n**Review before merging:**\n- Five reviewers checked the branch: code, security, error handling, conventions, and a run of all 20 quality commands. Security found nothing, and `npm audit` reported 0 advisories.\n- The code and error-handling reviews found 6 serious problems and 10 smaller ones. All 16 are fixed, each with a test that fails without its fix. One was already visible on the site: the persist page showed a fourth example that doesn't exist.\n- A second review of those fixes found 5 new problems they had caused, and I fixed those too.\n- The convention review raised 3 minor notes on the wording of existing commit messages. They stay as they are, because changing them would mean rewriting pushed history.\n- On the pull request, CodeQL raised 4 high-severity alerts about tag stripping. The stripped text is only compared or counted, never put back into a page, but I replaced all eight tag-stripping spots with one helper that has no regex. CodeQL then reported 0 open alerts.\n- On the final commit, GitHub ran 19 checks: 18 passed and 1 was skipped, the deploy job, which only runs after the merge.\n\n**After the deploy, checked on acs.synapti.ai:**\n- The site build and the Cloudflare Pages deploy both succeeded.\n- Every page I checked shows the merged commit a4c00cd: home, mutate, the 1.1.0 Standard and the release notes.\n- The release notes page has its timeline and 5 section figures.\n- The mutate page has 8 figures, and its neighbour caption has the corrected direction.\n- The persist page says it has 3 examples.\n- Markdown copies are served as Markdown.\n- I looked at the live home and mutate pages myself.\n\n**Still open:**\n- Nobody has compared the site with synapti.ai to confirm nothing was copied.\n- It hasn't been tested with a real screen reader.\n- I'm still waiting for your Safari results.\n- The old `spike/issue-120-astro` branch still needs `! git branch -D spike/issue-120-astro`.\n- The merged `feature/issue-125-*` branches are still on GitHub and on this machine. I can delete them if you want.\n- The disk has about 8 GB free. This session's scratch folder still holds about 3 GB of repository clones from earlier work, which I can delete if you say so."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":727,"cache_read_input_tokens":534570,"output_tokens":837,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":727,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":837,"cache_read_input_tokens":534570,"cache_creation_input_tokens":727,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":727},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"3b5362c1-5725-401d-b8cb-2ee99467139b","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgzpoVreSP4KFbEw6vXdh","requestRef":"4de8e764-cbed-4934-b351-c5047d2ef0a1","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"d6678304-9703-4f26-a189-91b00d17d0d2","timestamp":"2026-11-13T11:10:44.861Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-2","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"ef9f3fc8-12b6-4fe4-9f49-aaeedec05648","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/danielbentes/agent-capability-standard/.claude/worktrees/wf_08f3cd25-f