s-ai-policy-quality (1): robots.txt allows OAI-SearchBot, Claude-SearchBot, PerplexityBot; served as text/plain.\n- mcp-registry-listed (3): official MCP Registry / Smithery / npm \"mcp\" package. External publishing: NOT in this round.\n- npm-sdk-package (1), agent-plugins-repo (bonus): out of scope.\n- agent-rules-repo (emerging 1): AGENTS.md or .cursorrules in the public repo, documented from home, docs or llms.txt.\n- registry-branding (emerging 2): MCP server card has title, icons[].src, description.\n- noindex-directives (1): no noindex on the home page (pages.dev only has it; keep).\n\n## Access\n- sitemap (1): /sitemap.xml with lastmod dates.\n- content-no-js (5, gate): home ≥500 chars text in raw HTML, one H1, sequential headings.\n- bot-detection (2, gate), agent-crawler-reachability (1, gate), robots-agent-user-policy (1): ChatGPT-User, OAI-SearchBot, Claude-User, PerplexityBot not blocked (Cloudflare bot rules); robots allows ChatGPT-User, Claude-User, Perplexity-User.\n- agent-discovery-file (emerging 2): /.well-known/agent-skills/index.json listing skills with name and description.\n- agent-skills-index-v2 (bonus 2): index.json \"$schema\": \"https://schemas.agentskills.io/discovery/0.2.0/schema.json\"; each entry type (\"skill-md\" or \"archive\"), url, digest \"sha256:<64 lowercase hex>\" of the artifact's raw bytes (one is verified).\n- a2a-agent-card (bonus 2): /.well-known/agent-card.json (A2A). Only if honest (the site is not an agent; probably skip).\n- pricing-md (emerging): skip (free open standard) unless a one-line \"free, Apache-2.0\" pricing.md is honest — maintainer did not ask; skip.\n- nlweb-schema-feeds (emerging 1): `schemamap:` in robots.txt → Schema Map XML of JSONL/RSS feeds. Optional.\n- mcp-well-known-discovery (bonus 2): server card listed in /.well-known/ai-catalog.json or at <server URL>/server-card; also /.well-known/mcp/server-card.json, /.well-known/mcp.json, llms.txt mention.\n- link-headers-discovery (bonus 1): Link heade