{"parentUuid":"d1ef96e3-abb0-4471-8082-7614cf4ea2cb","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch118bSCMwzF6ybVfAQkU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've opened issue #127 to track the agent-readiness work, created branch `feature/issue-127-agent-ready` from `main`, and started the build. Four builders are working in parallel:\n\n- **Data API:** read-only JSON under `/api/v1/` (capabilities, layers, edges, workflows, profiles, diagnostics, and a page index), an OpenAPI 3.1 description at `/openapi.json`, an RFC 9727 API catalog, and a `/developers/` page linked from the home page.\n- **Discovery:** a shorter `llms.txt` with a \"when to use this standard\" section and one file per section, `/llms.md` and `/agents.md`, and frontmatter on the Markdown copies. Also:\n  - last-modified dates in the sitemap;\n  - JSON-LD and `og:type` on the home page;\n  - the ARD and AI-catalog discovery files;\n  - an index of the repository's 42 skills with a SHA-256 digest each;\n  - about, contact and privacy pages, with contact through GitHub only;\n  - `AGENTS.md` at the repository root;\n  - a look at why the Standard page is over the size limit.\n- **Request-time code on Cloudflare Pages:**\n  - Markdown when an agent sends `Accept: text/markdown` or appends `.md` to a page URL;\n  - a Markdown 404 for agents;\n  - JSON errors for unknown API paths;\n  - `Link` headers;\n  - the read-only docs MCP server at `acs.synapti.ai/mcp`, with tools `search_standard`, `read_capability`, `read_workflow` and `read_page`, plus its server card.\n- **WebMCP:** read-only in-page tools for browser agents, which do nothing in browsers that lack the API.\n\nThe builders won't fake anything to pass a check: no OAuth, no payment protocols, no API keys. Listing the MCP server in public registries means publishing outside this repository, so it isn't in this round.\n\nAfter the build, an integrator merges the parts, runs every check, and tests the request-time code locally with `wrangler pages dev`. An independent reviewer then uses the site as an agent would, starting from the home page with no prior knowledge, and the problems it finds get fixed. When that finishes I'll open the pull request, merge it once the checks pass, confirm the deploy, and run the ora.ai scan again."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7946,"cache_read_input_tokens":571955,"output_tokens":781,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":7946,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":781,"cache_read_input_tokens":571955,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7946,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":7946},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"f7274297-7bee-4e9b-b106-23fd30afb8bf","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Ch118aZcY95cEin5XpA2t","requestRef":"3f9c1831-d906-4d19-a76b-0a62c17e4b3a","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"b3a1caaa-0c5a-4227-8a4f-880dc5331549","timestamp":"2026-11-13T13:26:10.728Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-2","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"ef9f3fc8-12b6-4fe4-9f49-aaeedec05648","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/danielbentes/agent-capability-standard/.claude/worktrees/i127","sessionId":"ef9f3fc8-12b6-4fe4-9f49-aaeedec05648","version":"2.1.322","gitBranch":"feature/issue-127-agent-ready","slug":"i-just-came-across-imperative-newell"}
