{"parentUuid":"e58293f9-d1e1-4c21-9daa-311fbfcfe1ab","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch1Co2Aa7vf4Hm8apTHRy","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01J2DNFHsDK2QQPHKQJoViYQ","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/danielbentes/agent-capability-standard/.claude/worktrees/i127 && REDACTED && cat > $S/msg-review2.txt <<'EOF'\nfix(site): answer the pre-PR review of the agent interfaces\n\nRead failures:\n- A site file that answers anything but 200 or 404, or JSON that does\n  not parse, is now a read failure (ReadFailed), never \"no capability\n  with that id\". The MCP server answers it with -32603 and a retry\n  message.\n- The worker logs why a request failed open or why /mcp failed. When the\n  static files fail too it answers 503 (problem+json under /api/)\n  instead of rejecting.\n- page-dates fails on a source file that does not exist, and\n  agent-skills names the SKILL.md whose front matter is empty or broken.\n- The in-page search_standard rejects an out-of-range limit as the MCP\n  tool does, and drops one result whose fragment fails to load instead\n  of failing the whole search.\n\nSearch, pages and protocol:\n- search_standard matches whole stemmed words, not parts of words (\"e\"\n  matched every page). A multi-word workflow id earns its id bonus when\n  the query names every word of it.\n- read_page's section takes \"Parent > Heading\" and, for a heading that\n  repeats, lists every match instead of returning the first.\n- The Markdown copy of a redirected page address (/spec/index.md,\n  /spec.md) follows the same redirect as the page. read_page follows it\n  too, and search leaves the redirected page out.\n- /mcp accepts any serialized origin, including browser extensions, and\n  names an unsupported MCP-Protocol-Version header as that.\n- The worker entry notes the project's fail-open setting for the\n  free plan's daily limit.\n\nRefs #127\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Jea2Va3FATnCydAsWsbLXR\nEOF\ngit add -A site && git status --short | head -20 && git commit -q -F $S/msg-review2.txt && git push -q origin feature/issue-127-agent-ready && git rev-parse HEAD && git ls-remote origin feature/issue-127-agent-ready","description":"Commit and push the review fixes"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1333,"cache_read_input_tokens":309001,"output_tokens":1055,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":102},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1333,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1055,"cache_read_input_tokens":309001,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1333,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1333},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"toolInputStreamMs":8639,"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01J2DNFHsDK2QQPHKQJoViYQ":{"command":"cd /Users/danielbentes/agent-capability-standard/.claude/worktrees/i127 && REDACTED && cat > $S/msg-review2.txt <<'EOF'\nfix(site): answer the pre-PR review of the agent interfaces\n\nRead failures:\n- A site file that answers anything but 200 or 404, or JSON that does\n  not parse, is now a read failure (ReadFailed), never \"no capability\n  with that id\". The MCP server answers it with -32603 and a retry\n  message.\n- The worker logs why a request failed open or why /mcp failed. When the\n  static files fail too it answers 503 (problem+json under /api/)\n  instead of rejecting.\n- page-dates fails on a source file that does not exist, and\n  agent-skills names the SKILL.md whose front matter is empty or broken.\n- The in-page search_standard rejects an out-of-range limit as the MCP\n  tool does, and drops one result whose fragment fails to load instead\n  of failing the whole search.\n\nSearch, pages and protocol:\n- search_standard matches whole stemmed words, not parts of words (\"e\"\n  matched every page). A multi-word workflow id earns its id bonus when\n  the query names every word of it.\n- read_page's section takes \"Parent > Heading\" and, for a heading that\n  repeats, lists every match instead of returning the first.\n- The Markdown copy of a redirected page address (/spec/index.md,\n  /spec.md) follows the same redirect as the page. read_page follows it\n  too, and search leaves the redirected page out.\n- /mcp accepts any serialized origin, including browser extensions, and\n  names an unsupported MCP-Protocol-Version header as that.\n- The worker entry notes the project's fail-open setting for the\n  free plan's daily limit.\n\nRefs #127\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Jea2Va3FATnCydAsWsbLXR\nEOF\ngit add -A site && git status --short | head -20 && git commit -q -F $S/msg-review2.txt && git push -q origin feature/issue-127-agent-ready && git rev-parse HEAD && git ls-remote origin feature/issue-127-agent-ready","description":"Commit and push the review fixes"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"adcc0225-caf6-426f-82df-3704175d0cbc","apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011Ch1Co1uhqZtbTUcF17NDq","requestRef":"119ff38f-ed0f-4b86-9d34-77cdf82b870b","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"25abc6ad-d2bf-48aa-919e-6c9cc2a88fa8","timestamp":"2026-11-13T15:59:10.916Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-2","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"ef9f3fc8-12b6-4fe4-9f49-aaeedec05648","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/danielbentes/agent-capability-standard/.claude/worktrees/i127/site","sessionId":"ef9f3fc8-12b6-4fe4-9f49-aa