{"parentUuid":"9b17948f-a3fc-4dcf-b88d-5e91d7e3953d","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"b8e3532c-009a-4f27-9ceb-898891311b1f","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WYM2HxgJYG4KYaWFrxyPnE","type":"tool_result","content":"?? .decisions/\n23Gi free","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"3b275c54-2418-453d-b54f-c8522e73af95","timestamp":"2026-11-13T19:58:07.203Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"?? .decisions/\n23Gi free","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"9b17948f-a3fc-4dcf-b88d-5e91d7e3953d","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"session_id":"ef9f3fc8-12b6-4fe4-9f49-aaeedec05648","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/danielbentes/agent-capability-standard/.claude/worktrees/i127","sessionId":"ef9f3fc8-12b6-4fe4-9f49-aaeedec05648","version":"2.1.322","gitBranch":"feature/issue-127-agent-ready","slug":"i-just-came-across-imperative-newell"}
{"parentUuid":"3b275c54-2418-453d-b54f-c8522e73af95","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch1X2dXHi1awhVfCUCVhU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"PR #128 is ready to merge; I haven't merged it, because merging publishes the site. All 15 GitHub checks pass on 5c02584, the deploy step is skipped as it always is on PRs, no CodeQL alerts are open, and GitHub shows the merge as clean.\n\nI also checked one more thing myself: Cloudflare's docs say its header and redirect files don't apply to pages the worker serves. Without a fix, the `noindex` on pages.dev copies, the API's headers and the `/spec/` redirect would have been lost on the live site. The worker now applies the same rules itself.\n\n**What an agent can now do:**\n- **Discover:** find everything from the site's own well-known files and response headers.\n- **Read pages:** get any page as Markdown by adding `.md` to its URL or by asking for Markdown in the request.\n- **Read the data:** get the standard's data (capabilities, workflows, profiles, diagnostic codes) as JSON, described by an OpenAPI file.\n- **Query:** use a read-only MCP server at `https://acs.synapti.ai/mcp`, with four tools for searching and reading.\n\nOn top of that:\n- Browser agents get the same four tools inside the page.\n- `llms.txt` is down from 31.7K to 15.3K characters and says when to use the standard.\n- The home page has structured data, and the sitemap has dates.\n- There are new about, contact and privacy pages, with contact through GitHub only.\n\n**Reviews:**\n- **First review:** an independent reviewer used the site as an agent and raised 9 findings; all are fixed.\n- **Pre-PR review:** found 16 more (error handling, search quality, redirects, protocol details); all are fixed.\n- **Re-review of those fixes:** caught two regressions I had introduced (plural searches and headings containing \">\"); both are fixed.\n- **Security and conventions:** the security review found no defects, and the convention check found nothing.\n\n**Checks on the final head:**\n\n| Check | Result |\n|---|---|\n| Site tests | 1119 pass |\n| Build checks | All pass |\n| Python tests | 1552 pass |\n| Accessibility, light and dark at 1440 and 360px | No violations |\n\nThe Python tests ran on an earlier commit, and the accessibility check on the commit before the last; the later commits only touch the site's code, not its layout. I also ran local probes of the worker and the MCP server with Cloudflare's local runtime; none of this has been checked on the live site yet.\n\n**Not done:**\n- **External listings:** the MCP server isn't listed in the public registries, because that means publishing outside this repository.\n- **The Standard page stays long:** about 114K characters, over the roughly 100K scanners expect. The MCP tool serves it in parts.\n- **Four tools, not three:** ora prefers three or fewer for a docs server; cutting one is your call.\n\nTwo things before merging:\n\n1. **Fail open.** The free plan allows 100,000 worker requests a day, and every page view now uses one. Please check that the Cloudflare Pages project `acs-docs` is set to fail open (Settings > Runtime > Fail open / closed). Then pages keep loading after the limit, and only the Markdown answers and `/mcp` pause until midnight UTC.\n2. **Merge.** Do you want me to merge PR #128? Merging deploys the site. After the deploy I'll check these things on the live site, then run the ora.ai scan again and list what's still missing:\n   - the Markdown answers;\n   - the `/mcp` server;\n   - the well-known files;\n   - the API headers;\n   - the `/spec/` redirect;\n   - the `noindex` header on pages.dev."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":349,"cache_read_input_tokens":350837,"output_tokens":1210,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":349,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1210,"cache_read_input_tokens":350837,"cache_creation_input_tokens":349,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":349},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"984bb1eb-4eba-475e-a9bc-540e909c4ba5","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Ch1X2dHQWLNt552oBfcam","requestRef":"f069fac2-5210-4097-bcc6-4f933f443d12","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"17fe5341-1b96-42b5-9b26-8ac4e011c80e","timestamp":"2026-11-13T19:58:18.305Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-2","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"ef9f3fc8-12b6-4fe4-9f49-aaeedec05648","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/danielbentes/agent-capability-standard/.claude/worktrees/i127","sessionId":"ef9f3fc8-12b6-4fe4-9f49-aaeedec05648","version":"2.1.322","gitBranch":"feature/issue-127-agent-ready","slug":"i-just-came-across-imperative-newell"}
