ur resources with progressive trust\",\"bonus\":false,\"specUrl\":\"https://agenticresourcediscovery.org/\",\"data\":{\"entryCount\":5,\"validEntryCount\":5,\"hasTrustManifest\":false,\"hasRegistry\":false,\"hasUrnIdentifiers\":true,\"source\":\"ard\"},\"maturity\":\"verified\",\"tier\":\"required\"},{\"id\":\"ai-catalog-published\",\"name\":\"AI Catalog discovery\",\"description\":\"The AI Catalog Standard (ai-catalog.io, Agent-Card WG) specifies its own discovery path, /.well-known/ai-catalog.json, separately from ARD's a\n...\n</persisted-output>","is_error":false}]}}
