}, description }` - follow it verbatim to trigger a fresh scan.\n\nIf `domain` differs from `new URL(finalUrl).hostname`, the score reflects a redirected host.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"f105c400-cd60-45e4-aa31-26f3e0c346e4","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"session_id":"ef9f3fc8-12b6-4fe4-9f49-aaeedec05648","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/danielbentes/agent-capability-standard/.claude/worktrees/i-followup","sessionId":"ef9f3fc8-12b6-4fe4-9f49-aaeedec05648","version":"2.1.322","gitBranch":"feature/agent-ready-followup","slug":"i-just-came-across-imperative-newell"}
