lare's own Markdown conversion feature isn't available on this zone's Free plan. The site's own Markdown copies already cover what that feature would do.\n\n## Verification\n\nOn this branch's head:\n\n- `npm run check`: 0 errors.\n- `npm test`: 46 files, 1129 tests pass. New tests cover:\n  - the token estimate, with a hand count of the fixture;\n  - both headers on every way of asking for Markdown;\n  - a HEAD request, which gets the estimate but no body;\n  - a 304, which gets no estimate;\n  - the content signal on HTML pages, static files and the Markdown 404;\n  - the content signal in every robots.txt group.\n- `npm run build`: every check passes.\n- Under `wrangler pages dev`, both headers appear on Markdown copies, negotiated Markdown, HEAD requests and the Markdown 404, and the content signal appears on HTML pages and static files. The Standard's copy is estimated at 27,807 tokens.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01Jea2Va3FATnCydAsWsbLXR\nEOF\ngh pr create --repo synaptiai/agent-capability-standard --base main --head feature/content-signals --title \"feat(site): content signals, Markdown token estimate, LinkedIn link\" --body-file $S/pr-signals.md","description":"Commit, push and open the PR"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"d4262b8a-c8e2-406a-a334-b836ccf1deb1","apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011Ch2qhNvPRY9Mc9yeqe117","requestRef":"1dcc5aa0-8da9-4849-b983-53825b3ae41a","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"0a01b48b-b5d1-40fb-b11a-db94b2090342","timestamp":"2026-11-14T12:43:44.789Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-2","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"ef9f3fc8-12b6-4fe4-9f49-aaeedec05648","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/danielbentes/agent-capability-standard/.claude/worktrees/i-signals/site","sessionId":"ef9f3fc8-12b6-4fe4-9f49-aaeedec05648","version":"2.1.322","gitBranch":"feature/content-signal