{"parentUuid":"921f50d6-d43b-4578-9aa0-1847f973ec92","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch2qiW5mVG1oi3R4K2VN9","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01EwJpHLvm423VHc8Mp2yBAV","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"REDACTED.txt","content":"feat(site): content signals, Markdown token estimate, LinkedIn link\n\n- Every response carries Content-Signal: search=yes, ai-input=yes,\n  ai-train=yes (contentsignals.org), from _headers and the worker's copy\n  of its rules; every robots.txt group states the same.\n- Every Markdown answer carries X-Markdown-Tokens, an estimate of its\n  length in tokens (one per four characters). A 304 carries none.\n- The publisher's JSON-LD sameAs adds its LinkedIn page.\n- The developers page describes both headers.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Jea2Va3FATnCydAsWsbLXR\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1547,"cache_read_input_tokens":259160,"output_tokens":1356,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":19},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1547,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1356,"cache_read_input_tokens":259160,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1547,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1547},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"toolInputStreamMs":3443,"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01EwJpHLvm423VHc8Mp2yBAV":{"file_path":"REDACTED.txt","content":"feat(site): content signals, Markdown token estimate, LinkedIn link\n\n- Every response carries Content-Signal: search=yes, ai-input=yes,\n  ai-train=yes (contentsignals.org), from _headers and the worker's copy\n  of its rules; every robots.txt group states the same.\n- Every Markdown answer carries X-Markdown-Tokens, an estimate of its\n  length in tokens (one per four characters). A 304 carries none.\n- The publisher's JSON-LD sameAs adds its LinkedIn page.\n- The developers page describes both headers.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Jea2Va3FATnCydAsWsbLXR\n"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"b012279f-8651-42a7-ae09-cf30195aca9f","apiBlockIndex":3,"requestId":"req_011Ch2qiVq93j9vfreuHSzRu","requestRef":"3519f582-c5c9-4cbf-a685-6b99517aebed","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"3f77405a-43ca-490b-9d6b-b79cd767577a","timestamp":"2026-11-14T12:43:52.557Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-2","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"ef9f3fc8-12b6-4fe4-9f49-aaeedec05648","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/danielbentes/agent-capability-standard/.claude/worktrees/i-signals/site","sessionId":"ef9f3fc8-12b6-4fe4-9f49-aaeedec05648","version":"2.1.322","gitBranch":"feature/content-signals","slug":"i-just-came-across-imperative-newell"}
{"parentUuid":"3f77405a-43ca-490b-9d6b-b79cd767577a","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"8bb93c99-2c16-4af0-87ac-d9afe536a35f","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EwJpHLvm423VHc8Mp2yBAV","type":"tool_result","content":"File created successfully at: REDACTED.txt (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"uuid":"1c0ee37a-12b6-4b04-95a9-f4047a383c44","timestamp":"2026-11-14T12:43:52.709Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"create","filePath":"REDACTED.txt","content":"feat(site): content signals, Markdown token estimate, LinkedIn link\n\n- Every response carries Content-Signal: search=yes, ai-input=yes,\n  ai-train=yes (contentsignals.org), from _headers and the worker's copy\n  of its rules; every robots.txt group states the same.\n- Every Markdown answer carries X-Markdown-Tokens, an estimate of its\n  length in tokens (one per four characters). A 304 carries none.\n- The publisher's JSON-LD sameAs adds its LinkedIn page.\n- The developers page describes both headers.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Jea2Va3FATnCydAsWsbLXR\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"3f77405a-43ca-490b-9d6b-b79cd767577a","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"session_id":"ef9f3fc8-12b6-4fe4-9f49-aaeedec05648","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/danielbentes/agent-capability-standard/.claude/worktrees/i-signals/site","sessionId":"ef9f3fc8-12b6-4fe4-9f49-aaeedec05648","version":"2.1.322","gitBranch":"feature/content-signals","slug":"i-just-came-across-imperative-newell"}
{"parentUuid":"1c0ee37a-12b6-4b04-95a9-f4047a383c44","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch2qiW5mVG1oi3R4K2VN9","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01G9TmdBRzddrjXMHMamcVcg","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"REDACTED.md","content":"## Summary\n\n- **Content signals.** Every response now carries `Content-Signal: search=yes, ai-input=yes, ai-train=yes`, following contentsignals.org. It says the site's content may be used in search results, as input to AI answers, and for AI training. Every group in robots.txt states the same, because a crawler reads only the group that names it.\n- **Markdown token estimate.** Every Markdown answer now carries `X-Markdown-Tokens`, an estimate of its length in tokens at one per four characters. This is the same header Cloudflare's own Markdown conversion adds. A 304 answer has no body, so it carries no estimate.\n- **LinkedIn.** The publisher's structured data now links https://www.linkedin.com/company/synapti-ai/.\n- **Developers page.** It now describes both headers.\n\nCloudflare's own Markdown conversion feature isn't available on this zone's Free plan. The site's own Markdown copies already cover what that feature would do.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `npm run check`: 0 errors.\n- `npm test`: 46 files, 1129 tests pass. New tests cover:\n  - the token estimate, with a hand count of the fixture;\n  - both headers on every way of asking for Markdown;\n  - a HEAD request, which gets the estimate but no body;\n  - a 304, which gets no estimate;\n  - the content signal on HTML pages, static files and the Markdown 404;\n  - the content signal in every robots.txt group.\n- `npm run build`: every check passes.\n- Under `wrangler pages dev`, both headers appear on Markdown copies, negotiated Markdown, HEAD requests and the Markdown 404, and the content signal appears on HTML pages and static files. The Standard's copy is estimated at 27,807 tokens.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01Jea2Va3FATnCydAsWsbLXR\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1547,"cache_read_input_tokens":259160,"output_tokens":1356,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":19},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1547,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1356,"cache_read_input_tokens":259160,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1547,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1547},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"toolInputStreamMs":6045,"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01G9TmdBRzddrjXMHMamcVcg":{"file_path":"REDACTED.md","content":"## Summary\n\n- **Content signals.** Every response now carries `Content-Signal: search=yes, ai-input=yes, ai-train=yes`, following contentsignals.org. It says the site's content may be used in search results, as input to AI answers, and for AI training. Every group in robots.txt states the same, because a crawler reads only the group that names it.\n- **Markdown token estimate.** Every Markdown answer now carries `X-Markdown-Tokens`, an estimate of its length in tokens at one per four characters. This is the same header Cloudflare's own Markdown conversion adds. A 304 answer has no body, so it carries no estimate.\n- **LinkedIn.** The publisher's structured data now links https://www.linkedin.com/company/synapti-ai/.\n- **Developers page.** It now describes both headers.\n\nCloudflare's own Markdown conversion feature isn't available on this zone's Free plan. The site's own Markdown copies already cover what that feature would do.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `npm run check`: 0 errors.\n- `npm test`: 46 files, 1129 tests pass. New tests cover:\n  - the token estimate, with a hand count of the fixture;\n  - both headers on every way of asking for Markdown;\n  - a HEAD request, which gets the estimate but no body;\n  - a 304, which gets no estimate;\n  - the content signal on HTML pages, static files and the Markdown 404;\n  - the content signal in every robots.txt group.\n- `npm run build`: every check passes.\n- Under `wrangler pages dev`, both headers appear on Markdown copies, negotiated Markdown, HEAD requests and the Markdown 404, and the content signal appears on HTML pages and static files. The Standard's copy is estimated at 27,807 tokens.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01Jea2Va3FATnCydAsWsbLXR\n"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"b012279f-8651-42a7-ae09-cf30195aca9f","apiBlockIndex":4,"requestId":"req_011Ch2qiVq93j9vfreuHSzRu","requestRef":"3519f582-c5c9-4cbf-a685-6b99517aebed","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"287f5131-b190-4ca7-beda-41f793a1066f","timestamp":"2026-11-14T12:43:58.609Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-2","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"ef9f3fc8-12b6-4fe4-9f49-aaeedec05648","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/danielbentes/agent-capability-standard/.claude/worktrees/i-signals/site","sessionId":"ef9f3fc8-12b6-4fe4-9f49-aaeedec05648","version":"2.1.322","gitBranch":"feature/content-signals","slug":"i-just-came-across-imperative-newell"}
