{"parentUuid":"ac0bde8d-4093-404b-a993-d57379f6b9ac","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch2te7smxEQxY9zJ5Hrrc","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"PR #130 is merged and deployed, and I checked the result on the live site:\n\n- **Content signal:** HTML pages, Markdown copies, the Markdown \"page not found\" and robots.txt all carry `Content-Signal: search=yes, ai-input=yes, ai-train=yes`. Fresh copies of static files have it too. The favicon and the preview image still show older cached copies without it; they'll pick it up when Cloudflare refreshes them.\n- **Token estimate:** every Markdown answer carries `x-markdown-tokens`. The Standard is estimated at 27,807 tokens and the home page at 4,557.\n- **LinkedIn:** the home page's structured data links the company page.\n\nI re-checked three items with ora's single-check endpoint:\n\n| ora check | Before | Now |\n|---|---|---|\n| Profile links | 0.5/1 | 1/1 (GitHub and LinkedIn) |\n| Markdown negotiation | pass | still passes |\n| AI crawler policy in robots.txt | pass | still passes |\n\n**Score.** ora's full scan is still a cached copy from 11:23, so its total still reads 78 (B). Since then, the in-page tools went from 6.4 to 8 and the profile links from 0.5 to 1, about 2 more points. Its next fresh scan should show about 80.\n\nAll three PRs (#128, #129, #130) are merged and deployed. No PRs are open, and I removed my three local worktrees. One worktree remains, for the earlier visuals branch, `feature/issue-125-site-visuals`. That PR merged earlier, so it can be removed if you want.\n\nWhat would still raise the score needs you, or would mean faking features:\n- listing the MCP server in the official MCP Registry or on Smithery;\n- search ranking, which builds over time;\n- the two API checks (error model and function-calling compatibility), which I left because they would need inputs and error cases the API doesn't have."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":659,"cache_read_input_tokens":267401,"output_tokens":635,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":659,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":635,"cache_read_input_tokens":267401,"cache_creation_input_tokens":659,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":659},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"6a9de055-27c9-456c-9a48-40482049134f","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Ch2te7c9s34xNxFKU4wfq","requestRef":"20884efc-ebab-46c8-96ea-0103f23acabb","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"005a8ba8-5b3d-4777-adcc-784fb99c155a","timestamp":"2026-11-14T13:22:14.321Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-2","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"ef9f3fc8-12b6-4fe4-9f49-aaeedec05648","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/danielbentes/agent-capability-standard","sessionId":"ef9f3fc8-12b6-4fe4-9f49-aaeedec05648","version":"2.1.322","gitBranch":"feature/content-signals","slug":"i-just-came-across-imperative-newell"}
